# Fullstack AI Harness

Use this entry before non-trivial implementation. Classify the task by impact layer, read the matching harness, identify the authority source, implement narrowly, and finish with evidence.

## Routing

- Frontend UI, interaction, design system, responsiveness: frontend or app profile harness.
- Backend route, service, domain logic, jobs: backend harness.
- Database schema, migration, seed, indexes: database harness.
- API contracts, OpenAPI, generated SDK: API contract harness.
- CI, static guards, flaky tests, regression triage: quality harness.
- Cross-project process or skill improvement: governance harness.

## Closeout

Every task should report business project changes, Harness SSOT changes, verification commands, evidence location, and any reusable guard or QA harness candidate.


